Error: Jet.InvalidTagPolicy: The tag `Risk` denies no destination
  --> Tests/UI/tag_marker_denies_nothing.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | Risk: struct {
    | ^^^^
 Why: A value tag's denials are its own `#FX(!…)` row, and a tag that denies nothing has no policy to enforce
 Fix: Write the destinations it may not reach above it: `#FX(!Net) Risk: struct { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidTagPolicy
